{"title":"Four Fours/5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Solution_7\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 7</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Solution_8\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 8</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Solution_9\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 9</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How to use four <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s to get to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> can be obtained by using one of the solutions for <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/25&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Four Fours/25 (page does not exist)\">25</a> and then taking the square root. For example:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/0/fb0074a4c04c4e2037693d224f0a56bbe299f119.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{!4 + !4 + !4 - \\sqrt{4}} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"170\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/6/2f648976e02d769ac9e492f726335ccec2bea85a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{4 \\times 4 + \\sqrt{!4} + \\Gamma(4)} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"202\" height=\"34\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/3/b5375f18ed668d736219f9c9f764490a350c7d15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\times 4 + 4 = 4 \\times 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"138\" height=\"15\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/8/d18adad2cbd3acdec13714ec959b8812d76a3866.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\frac{4 \\times 4 + 4}{4} = 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"122\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/6/f7698a3f9be9c1b3fe122d76f0ab6a65b8ebc627.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$!4 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/3/773ca870ad165c161aad31320c6fdc5449656722.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{!4 - 4 + 4 - 4 = 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"155\" height=\"27\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/6/426c08bd0b5e2a623e4e835b3f8c7840cfd32d8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{4 - 4} = 4^{0} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"109\" height=\"17\" />, so\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/e/7fef32ab029cd539425c49752dda8aaf451f7cd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{4^{4 - 4} + 4 = 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"111\" height=\"29\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/f/7cfeecbc0a633d2c239eefe3eb2805d2c4993eef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{4} + \\sqrt{4} = 2 + 2 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"171\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/1/0d13f4a1700755ddba70461132e810536f6148d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{4} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"48\" height=\"38\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/4/b840b81e59db5e647f95909cc983077fd51baf47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\sqrt{4} + \\sqrt{4} + \\frac{4}{4} = 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"152\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6\">Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/b/2bb2ebb7c06151336fd43db4fea1af2bf04355dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4!}{4} = 3! = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"92\" height=\"39\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/4/d9464bdd5295d293213c90867f7cd4a9a3cd4cf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\frac{4!}{4} - \\frac{4}{4} = 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"100\" height=\"50\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_7\">Solution 7</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 7\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/6/0b63b610ab445dc49a59f9c5863951aa6ec110fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{!4} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"64\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/1/0d13f4a1700755ddba70461132e810536f6148d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{4} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"48\" height=\"38\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/b/54b6dcd8c535a92bada7516326c0f4921e924d4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\sqrt{!4} + \\sqrt{!4} - \\frac{4}{4} = 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"163\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_8\">Solution 8</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 8\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/4/d94becbd05419e6c0741642b46a551d4aa0bbcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4! - 4 \\times 4 = 24 - 16 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"195\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/6/0b63b610ab445dc49a59f9c5863951aa6ec110fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{!4} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"64\" height=\"21\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/d/d0d9ebf8f841b8584d67d58f2b80348d08c2c973.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{4! - 4 \\times 4 - \\sqrt{!4} = 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"175\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_9\">Solution 9</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Four_Fours/5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 9\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/c/e0c7e70f50b5cc634741946146c927e25821ff34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$.\\overline{4} = \\frac{4}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"53\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/6/f7698a3f9be9c1b3fe122d76f0ab6a65b8ebc627.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$!4 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/c/4fc77cdc93a66e71b00bbf1616621ce336837fcb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{.\\overline{4} \\times !4 + \\frac{4}{4} = 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"124\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018084913\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 149/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4884/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37243:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018084913 and revision id 287598. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}